    "Approach windows require uninterrupted same-session bars and unchanged ST direction. 30m windows count 30m bars, not 5m bars.",
    "30m distance describes the last completed 30m close, not the current 5m price. Future flip labels are retrospective.",
    "Trade sums are not portfolio returns; feed comparability not established."
